
actually pretty trivial on a decent linux with a recent gcc 

enceladus$ 
enceladus$ uname -a 
Linux enceladus 5.18.5-genunix #1 SMP Sat Jun 18 19:45:56 EDT 2022 ppc64 GNU/Linux
enceladus$ 
enceladus$ echo $CC
/opt/gcc/imed/gcc12/bin/gcc
enceladus$ $CC --version
gcc (genunix Fri May 13 17:07:13 UTC 2022) 12.1.0
